### Slip Service First Slice — VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client fixtures
### PM 명시 BE spec 의 16 endpoint × 11 SlipStatus state machine 시나리오를 즉시 실행 가능한 형태로 정리.
###
### 사용법:
###   1) docker-compose up (api-gateway / auth-service / user-service / inventory-service / slip-service / postgres / eureka)
###   2) 아래 @salesToken / @warehouseToken / @managerToken / @accountantToken 변수를
###      auth-service /auth/login 응답의 JWT 로 채워 넣는다.
###   3) ### 블록을 위에서 아래로 순서대로 실행. 시나리오 2 의 slipId 가 3 에서 재사용됨.
###
### 토큰 발급 예시:
###   POST {{host}}/auth/login  body={"loginId":"manager01","password":"..."}
###   → response.token 을 @managerToken 에 복사.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@masterToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@managerToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@salesToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@warehouseToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@accountantToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]

### inventory-service V2 시드 deterministic UUID — 출고/입고 창고로 재사용.
@hqWarehouseId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000001
@vehicleWarehouseId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000002

### product-service / partner-service 가 발급한 실제 UUID 로 교체.
@testProductId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000003001
@testPartnerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000004001

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 1: 출고전표 목록 조회 (SALES) — GET /slips
### 기대: 200 + ApiResponse<Page<SlipResponse>> ($.data.content[])
###############################################################################
GET {{host}}/slips?status=DRAFT
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 2: 출고전표 신규 등록 (SALES) — POST /slips, 201 Created
### 기대: 201 + body $.data.id, $.data.slipNo (YYYY/MM/DD-N), $.data.status="DRAFT"
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/slips
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slipType": "OUTBOUND",
  "slipDate": "2026-05-04",
  "sourceWarehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "destinationWarehouseId": "{{vehicleWarehouseId}}",
  "partnerId": "{{testPartnerId}}",
  "partnerName": "테스트 거래처",
  "deliveryTag": "SALE",
  "memo": "초기 등록 시연",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
      "productName": "테스트 제품",
      "modelName": "MOD-001",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 100000,
      "note": "라인 메모"
    }
  ]
}

> {%
client.global.set("outboundSlipId", response.body.data.id);
client.global.set("outboundSlipNo", response.body.data.slipNo);
%}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 3: 출고전표 라이프사이클 — save → send → accept → process → complete → ship → deliver → confirm
### 권한 매트릭스:
###   save/send → SALES, accept/process/complete/ship/deliver → WAREHOUSE, confirm → ACCOUNTANT
### Q2-A: accept 시 InventoryClient.reserve, complete 시 deduct(fromReservation=true)
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/slips/{{outboundSlipId}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{outboundSlipId}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}

### accept → InventoryClient.reserve 호출 (콘솔 로그 확인)
POST {{host}}/slips/{{outboundSlipId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{outboundSlipId}}/process
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

### complete → InventoryClient.deduct(fromReservation=true) 호출
POST {{host}}/slips/{{outboundSlipId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{outboundSlipId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{outboundSlipId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

### 회계확정 → ACCOUNTANT
POST {{host}}/slips/{{outboundSlipId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accountantToken}}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 4: 입고전표 신규 등록 (SALES) — sourceWarehouseId 없음, slipType=INBOUND
### 기대: 201
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/slips
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slipType": "INBOUND",
  "slipDate": "2026-05-04",
  "destinationWarehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "partnerId": "{{testPartnerId}}",
  "partnerName": "발주 거래처",
  "deliveryTag": "SALE",
  "memo": "초기 입고",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
      "productName": "테스트 제품",
      "modelName": "MOD-001",
      "quantity": 100,
      "unitPrice": 80000,
      "note": "초도 입고 라인"
    }
  ]
}

> {%
client.global.set("inboundSlipId", response.body.data.id);
%}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 5: 입고전표 라이프사이클 — save → send → accept → process → complete → confirm
### ship/deliver 단계 스킵 (입고는 출하 단계 없음). complete 시 InventoryClient.inbound 호출.
### 입고전표에 ship() 시도 → 409 (시나리오 5 마지막에 음성 검증)
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inboundSlipId}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inboundSlipId}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inboundSlipId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inboundSlipId}}/process
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

### complete → InventoryClient.inbound 호출 (입고는 reserve/deduct 가 아니라 inbound)
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inboundSlipId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

### 입고전표 ship() 시도 — 409 기대 (입고는 ship 단계 없음)
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inboundSlipId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

### 입고는 COMPLETED → 바로 confirm 가능
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inboundSlipId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accountantToken}}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 6: reject 후 자동 release — Q2-A 결정 (reject_after_accept → release)
### 6-a) 새 출고전표 생성 (SALES) → save → send → accept (reserve 호출됨)
### 6-b) MANAGER 가 reject — InventoryClient.release 호출 검증 (콘솔 로그)
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/slips
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slipType": "OUTBOUND",
  "slipDate": "2026-05-04",
  "sourceWarehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "destinationWarehouseId": "{{vehicleWarehouseId}}",
  "partnerId": "{{testPartnerId}}",
  "partnerName": "거부 시나리오 거래처",
  "deliveryTag": "SALE",
  "memo": "reject 후 release 검증",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
      "productName": "테스트 제품",
      "modelName": "MOD-001",
      "quantity": 3,
      "unitPrice": 100000,
      "note": "거부 라인"
    }
  ]
}

> {%
client.global.set("rejectSlipId", response.body.data.id);
%}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{rejectSlipId}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{rejectSlipId}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{rejectSlipId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

### MANAGER 가 reject — release 자동 호출
POST {{host}}/slips/{{rejectSlipId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "고객 요청 취소 — release 검증"
}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 7: 잘못된 상태 전이 — DRAFT 에서 accept 시도 → 409
### 새 전표 만들고 save 없이 바로 accept → 409 BusinessException(CONFLICT)
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/slips
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slipType": "OUTBOUND",
  "slipDate": "2026-05-04",
  "sourceWarehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "destinationWarehouseId": "{{vehicleWarehouseId}}",
  "partnerId": "{{testPartnerId}}",
  "partnerName": "전이 가드 검증",
  "deliveryTag": "SALE",
  "memo": "잘못된 전이 검증",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
      "productName": "테스트",
      "modelName": "MOD-001",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 50000,
      "note": ""
    }
  ]
}

> {%
client.global.set("invalidTransitionSlipId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### DRAFT 상태에서 accept 시도 → 409 (SENT → ACCEPTED 만 허용)
POST {{host}}/slips/{{invalidTransitionSlipId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 8: 야적(STACK) 태그 자동 메모 — applyDeliveryTagAutoMemo
### deliveryTag=STACK 이면 응답 $.data.memo 에 `{slipDate}상차 {slipDate+1}하차` 자동 prepend
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/slips
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slipType": "OUTBOUND",
  "slipDate": "2026-05-04",
  "sourceWarehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "destinationWarehouseId": "{{vehicleWarehouseId}}",
  "partnerId": "{{testPartnerId}}",
  "partnerName": "야적 거래처",
  "deliveryTag": "STACK",
  "memo": "원본 메모",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
      "productName": "야적 제품",
      "modelName": "MOD-002",
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitPrice": 200000,
      "note": "야적 라인"
    }
  ]
}

### 응답 검증: $.data.memo 가 "2026/05/04상차 2026/05/05하차" 로 시작하고 "원본 메모" 포함

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 9: lookup-product (slip-output-format-slice 추가)
### facade endpoint — 모든 인증 role 이 모델명으로 ProductSummary 단건 조회.
### slip-service 의 ProductClient.lookupByModel → product-service /products/internal/lookup-by-model 위임.
### 기대: 200 + ApiResponse<ProductSummary> ($.data.modelName == 입력값)
###############################################################################
GET {{host}}/slips/lookup-product?modelName=SHA-W15K
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9-b: WAREHOUSE 조회 (모든 role 가능 검증 — 재고이동 작성 시 라인 lookup)
GET {{host}}/slips/lookup-product?modelName=SHA-W15K
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9-c: 미인증 → 403
GET {{host}}/slips/lookup-product?modelName=SHA-W15K
Accept: application/json

### 9-d: 미존재 모델명 → 404 (ProductClient.lookupByModel 의 NOT_FOUND propagate)
GET {{host}}/slips/lookup-product?modelName=UNKNOWN-MODEL-9999
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 10: Slice A (Sales Polish 2) — INSPECTING 단계 + dispatcher/inspector 자동 기입
### BE 신규 spec:
###   - SlipStatus.INSPECTING 신규 (PROCESSING → INSPECTING → COMPLETED)
###   - Slip.dispatcherUserId/SignedAt/inspectorUserId/SignedAt 4 필드 자동 기입
###   - SlipLine.specification VARCHAR(50) 신규 (선택)
###   - POST /slips/{id}/inspect 신규 endpoint (WAREHOUSE/INVENTORY/MANAGER/MASTER)
###############################################################################

### 10-a: specification 필드 포함 출고전표 신규 등록
POST {{host}}/slips
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slipType": "OUTBOUND",
  "slipDate": "2026-05-04",
  "sourceWarehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "destinationWarehouseId": "{{vehicleWarehouseId}}",
  "partnerId": "{{testPartnerId}}",
