client.global.set("inspectSlipId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 10-b: save → send (SALES)
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inspectSlipId}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inspectSlipId}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}

### 10-c: accept (WAREHOUSE) — 응답에 dispatcherUserId/SignedAt 자동 기입 검증
### 기대: $.data.dispatcherUserId == X-User-Id, $.data.dispatcherSignedAt != null
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inspectSlipId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inspectSlipId}}/process
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

### 10-d: complete (WAREHOUSE) — Slice A 신규: PROCESSING → INSPECTING (이전: COMPLETED)
### 기대: $.data.status == "INSPECTING"
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inspectSlipId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

### 10-e: inspect (WAREHOUSE) — INSPECTING → COMPLETED, inspectorUserId/SignedAt 자동 기입
### 기대: $.data.status == "COMPLETED", $.data.inspectorUserId == X-User-Id
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inspectSlipId}}/inspect
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

### 10-f: ship → deliver → confirm (출고전표 풀 10단계 마무리)
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inspectSlipId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inspectSlipId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/slips/{{inspectSlipId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accountantToken}}

