###############################################################################
### 시나리오 13: Slice B (notification-slice-B) — 배송기사 배치 자동 그룹 + 토큰 + Aligo SMS
### BE 신규 spec (plan §3, §4):
###   - Slip.driverName/driverPhone/deliveryBatchId 3 필드 (nullable)
###   - DeliveryBatch entity (id/batchToken/driverName/driverPhone/batchDate/tokenExpiresAt/smsSentAt/smsLastError)
###   - SmsGateway 추상화 (Aligo production / Mock test) — slip-service 내부
###   - 7 endpoints: /delivery-batches/{auto-group, GET list, GET one, send-sms, slips POST/DELETE, regenerate-token}
###   - 3 공개 endpoints (no auth, 토큰만): /public/batches/{token}, /public/batches/{token}/slips/{slipId}, signature
### 권한: MANAGER/MASTER (관리자). 공개 endpoint = NO AUTH.
### UUID 가드: 공개 응답에 batch.id / slip.id / line.productId 모두 미노출.
###############################################################################

### 13-a: driverName/driverPhone 필드 포함 출고전표 신규 등록 (SAVED 까지)
